WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.867
Your project workspace. Start in your organization. Open Secrets Management to choose a project.

2
00:00:02.867 --> 00:00:12.800
Give your project a home. Give the project a clear name. The real application creates it when you confirm.

3
00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:15.833
Your application, organized. Your new project opens with its environments and an empty, ready-to-use workspace.

4
00:00:15.833 --> 00:00:29.533
Learn by watching the controls. Open Clyffy. The scripted guide selects scope and requests reference names through authorized actions. Take over whenever you like.
